   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Food and Agriculture Organization (FAO)</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance to the Scaling Up Nutrition Programme (Phase II) in Zambia (SUN Phase II)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">OBJECTIVE:
To contribute to the reduction of malnutrition in pregnant and breast-feeding women and children under 2 years in 17 districts of Zambia, through production of diversified and nutritious foods and promotion of  access and consumption
OUTCOME
Outcome 1: Sustained demand, utilization and consumption of agriculture and forest foods for diversified diets in 17 districts of Zambia

OUTPUTS
Output 1: Access to diversified, nutritious food improved
Output 2: Sustainable production, value addition and marketing of non-wood forest products (NWFP) and foods for dietary diversity and income generation
Output 3: Food safety and diet quality enhanced
Output 4: Generation of nutrition information to monitor, prioritize and adapt interventions</narrative>
  </description>
